== Abiphone Contact ==
'''Brynmor'''{{'}}s [[Abiphone]] contact can be obtained by giving them a {{Item|Speckled Teacup}}.

== Trivia ==
*'''Brynmor''' replaced '''Malmar''', who appeared in various locations throughout the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}} every {{Green|7th}} day of each SkyBlock month. He sold the {{Item|Mining Pumpkin}}, with various buff changes.
*'''Brynmor''' is one of four NPCs mentioned during [[Cult_of_the_Fallen_Star#Dialogue| Cult of the Fallen Star]] Meeting #5, where '''Thondin''' states, "Brynmor always loses his {{Item|Speckled Teacup}}" as one of several examples suggesting that every NPC lives in a simulation.
*The price of {{Item|Packrat Shard}} and {{Item|Fiesta Flask}} aren't affected by {{Item|Shady Ring}} and its upgrades.
